Hand 1
https://tinyurl.com/2xhtyc54
qx|A1|st||rh||ah|Board 1 IMPs   -   August 16, 2024|pn|hondo717,danpsych,IraCT,Sputniks|
md|3SAHA53DAQJCJT8762,S9632HT874DK87CA9,SKJ4HK6DT653CKQ53,SQT875HQJ92D942C4|sv|0|
mb|1C|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now I have an interesting hand to bid. Normally you prefer to play in 3N to 5 of a minor almost all of the time. First, let me count my Bergen Points because a slam could be possible. Minor suit slams are hard to bid because most people don't have good methods to get there.|
PG| ***** 1 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I will first count my |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenstartingpoints,Bergen Starting Points^*N|CP||FP||at| followed by counting my |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. You probably like to ask why I do that as I am not the declarer. |

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow a link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 2 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|That is because although technically North will be declarer I am likely the one with longer trump. And generally the person with longer trump counts |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at|.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 3 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I have 16 HCP, 2 length points for 18 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenstartingpoints,Bergen Starting Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. To get my  |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at| once a fit is established I will add 2 points for the singleton and 1 point for the 6th club for 21 points. So we have a slam.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow a link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 4 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|There are a couple of ways to bid this.
^CI could bid 2@C which is a strong raise, but only 10+ points.
^CI could bid 3@S which is a |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=splinters,Splinter^*N|CP||FP||at|.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 5 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|On the other hand, I have all suits controlled other than clubs and I can find out if we have clubs controlled. So the easiest way to bid is just bid 4@D which I play as RKCB for clubs. It is called |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=kickback,Kickback^*N|CP||FP||at|. So I just bid 4@D.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 6 ***** |


mb|4D|an|rkcb for clubs|
pg| ***** 7 ***** |


mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|4S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|That is one key card missing and I need to find out if partner has the @CQ since we are missing one key card by bidding 4N. If the partner does not have the @CQ he bids 5@C. Otherwise, he bids the cheapest suit in which he holds a king--@HK.|
PG| ***** 8 ***** |


mb|P|mb|4N|an|queen ask|
PG| ***** 9 ***** |


mb|P|mb|5H|mb|P|mb|6C|mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
pg| ***** 10 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|

pc|D9|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I disagree with the diamond lead although it happens to work here. The @HQ is the best lead. You want to make an attacking lead. As it turns out the lead did not matter.|
