UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West has 4 diamonds and 2 clubs and 1 heart for sure and needs one more trick. As West, I might run all my diamonds and clubs and then throw South in with a club hoping N/S end up getting end-played. It probably should be down 1 but not down 3.|
PG| ***** 56 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Had I let North defend as he wanted to, West would have made the hand as I would have been end played. In real life most players often do not correctly defend so you end up making lots of contracts that you should not make. That is why aggressive bidding pays off. Defense is extremely difficult and even the best players often do not defend correctly.|
PG| ***** 57 ***** |


